  sequenceName: Mem_ch1_shelf
  lines:
  - speakerName: Narrator
    text: Cups, a jar of spices, a bowl with a chipped edge. Nothing precious, and
      all of it used every day.
  - speakerName: Narrator
    text: Ordinary things are what a home is made from.
